ADDITIONAL ATTRIBUTION NOTICE

This project is an independent implementation of the technique described in:

  "Addressable Recall Compaction for Long Context-Window Control in AI Agents"
  Thang Dang, Yuma Ichikawa, Sakina Fatima, Koichi Shirahata
  arXiv:2607.25066 (2026)
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.25066

The authors of the above paper are the originators of the CONCEPT this software
implements. This software is an original, independent implementation written
from the paper description; no source code from the authors or from any third
party was copied, forked, or adapted. We are grateful to the paper authors for
the research that makes this possible.
